{"steam_appid":5335510,"steam_name":"Moon Sweepers","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/5335510/784761556/7f2635011f003ecf63a4665d7277f9f6d33d67ef/1792140508/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1792140969","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257464240/50720742e4987d483b858ab6e919e0ea9fe0b937/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1792140969","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5335510/6985c316ef6f0988ea33b17954c097268134e3d1/ss_6985c316ef6f0988ea33b17954c097268134e3d1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792738801","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5335510/76c76f72cc035c7e0fc49ea971e0bf1c6e1ba6fa/ss_76c76f72cc035c7e0fc49ea971e0bf1c6e1ba6fa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792738801","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5335510/20a903f07aa2753cc99f11e26f08784f52ce5560/ss_20a903f07aa2753cc99f11e26f08784f52ce5560.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792738801","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5335510/63b9ea049e9f963379a0c671043965a8241818f9/ss_63b9ea049e9f963379a0c671043965a8241818f9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792738801","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5335510/86c13ff24fc6eea6b8199b88a0fe3a6a6009febb/ss_86c13ff24fc6eea6b8199b88a0fe3a6a6009febb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792738801"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5335510/extras/d3cd22d55948ee071dca537cf58ec473.avif?t=1792738801\" width=1296 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Moon is covered in dust. The Lunar Surface Department (LSD) has sent you and your crew to clean it up. Unfortunately, the budget only covered a toothbrush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Collect lunar dust, sell and use the earnings to buy better tools and upgrade your equipment. Turn an underfunded cleanup mission into a growing operation, one painfully small brushstroke at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5335510/extras/8d5c938f5dcd64d591f1c9d590907200.poster.avif?t=1792738801\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5335510/extras/8d5c938f5dcd64d591f1c9d590907200.webm?t=1792738801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5335510/extras/8d5c938f5dcd64d591f1c9d590907200.mp4?t=1792738801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5335510/extras/3c43c479c355c24960451456883de145.avif?t=1792738801\" width=1296 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Team up in online co-op lobbies of up to 16 players. Spread out to cover more ground or tackle the same area together. There’s enough dust to keep everyone busy. Whether everyone actually works is another matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Fill your storage with lunar dust, deliver it to a depot and launch shipments to get paid. Spend your earnings on new cleaning tools and increased carrying capacity so you can take on bigger jobs between deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5335510/extras/671f5e076548d042b6f0a580c45483d9.avif?t=1792738801\" width=1296 height=128 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                                                                                                                        </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Watch dusty terrain turn clean with every pass. Track your progress across the lunar surface, place depots near your work and put cleaning vehicles to use as your operation grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop being lazy, you’ve got whole Moon to clean. Better get started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5335510/extras/881779fc2f73464cdd23aee8f4d02b82.poster.avif?t=1792738801\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5335510/extras/881779fc2f73464cdd23aee8f4d02b82.webm?t=1792738801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5335510/extras/881779fc2f73464cdd23aee8f4d02b82.mp4?t=1792738801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 / AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super / AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["DragDrop Games"],"publishers":["DragDrop Games"],"release_date":"Oct 23, 2026"}